WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
Treasure Island

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.800
My old friend, Flint. I'll show you how to destroy a fort.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:34.640
FIRE!

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.980
Silver's men are attacking!

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:55.930
Treasure
Island

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:55.730
Takarajima

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:04.540
saa ikou

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:04.540
Come, let's go

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:07.630
yume ni mita shima heto

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:07.630
To the island that I've dreamed of

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:11.470
nami wo koete kaze ni notte

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:11.470
Across the waves, on the wind

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.350
umi hedeyou

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.350
We'll travel the oceans

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.270
ikute ni wa

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.270
Many of us

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:20.270
minna mada shiranai

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:20.270
Still don't know of

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:24.020
fushigi na hiru to yoru toga

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:24.020
The days and nights full of mystery

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.520
matte iru darou

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.520
That await us there

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:30.030
itsumo shinji you

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:30.030
We must always have trust

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.280
magokoro wo

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.280
And be sincere

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:39.540
yuuki wo mune ni susumou yo

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:39.540
And have courage in our hearts to move forward

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:42.670
tade hitotsu no

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:42.670
I only...

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.090
akogare dake wa

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.090
...have one desire

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:48.380
doko no dare ni mo

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:48.380
And no one...

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:55.090
kese wa shinai sa

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:55.090
...will ever take it away

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.640
tade hitotsu no

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.640
I only...

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.940
akogare dake wa

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.940
...have one desire

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:07.270
doko no dare ni mo

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:07.270
And no one...

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:14.200
kese wa shinai sa

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:14.200
...will ever take it away

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:25.090
episode

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:25.090
We're Castaways...?!

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.420
Where are they bombing us from?

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:38.340
With the ship being that very far off,
how can they be so accurate?

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:42.810
They must have moved the ship closer during the night.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:48.810
Hey, it's too dangerous here.
Let's withdraw to the mountains!

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.770
Y-Yes, it's our only hope!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.210
Go!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.400
Hurry up!

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:00.700
Hurry!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.280
We can't go out that way!

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.880
Here it comes!

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.300
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:36.940
Jim, you take too many risks.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.860
But we can't just stay here!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:45.780
Oh no, the cabin!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.270
Wait, Jim!
Where are you going?

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.810
It's it obvious?!

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.790
I'm going to cut the moorings on the Hispaniola!

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:25.720
If I do, it will drift out to sea and we'll be out of its reach!

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:26.950
Move, Gray.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:28.530
Jim!

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:31.910
Jim!

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.390
Hey, Puppy!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:46.760
Yeah?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:49.310
Look, the little guy's trying to escape.
Grab 'im!

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:50.150
Aye!

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.300
Where are you going, kid?

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:24.880
None of your business!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.600
You really want to fight me?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.730
You little bastard!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.660
You're pretty good, kid.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:47.610
But now...!

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:00.330
Puppy!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:01.310
Little bastard...!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.010
Come here!

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.920
You dirty, little...!

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:25.090
Hey, Puppy!
Your gun is still loaded, isn't it?!

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.560
Take aim!
Fire!

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:27.450
Understood.
Calm down.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.710
I have plenty of time.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.800
What's this?
I think my powder got wet...

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.330
Idiot!

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:12.110
Where's Jim?
Where'd he go?

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:16.080
He left.
He wants to try and save us.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.580
What?!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.660
How reckless...

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.960
If he left the fort,
they might kill him!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:23.040
Why didn't you stop him, Gray?!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.190
If you'd seen the look in his eyes,

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.010
you'd have let him go too.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:32.140
I see...
Yes.

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:35.420
And, was Jim able to escape?

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.620
I'm not sure,

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:40.270
but I choose to believe that he did.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.770
We must believe in him, gentlemen!
Don't you agree?!

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:54.380
Hurry, Benbow!

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:19.850
It's been a long time!
Clean water!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:48.780
Light!

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:02.360
Hello.
Hey, Jim!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:03.600
Ben Gunn!

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:12.180
What a surprise!
I've been looking for you!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.530
You've been living here?

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.660
You were looking for me?

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:20.080
Really?
I'm sorry for that.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:24.160
I wanted to pick coconuts and,
as you can see, I fell.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.790
I must stay in bed.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:26.710
Does it hurt?

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:30.380
No, I'm feeling much better.
I'll be able to walk soon.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.780
More importantly, Jim.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:35.140
Even here, I can hear
the roar of the cannons.

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:37.180
There must have been trouble down at the fort.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:46.100
I see, you want to cut the
moorings on the Hispaniola.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.980
That's a good idea. Did you think of it all by yourself, Jim?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:51.460
Well, yes.

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:54.460
How are you going to reach the Hispaniola?

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:58.950
Well, simply put, I'm gonna swim!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.760
I'm a very good swimmer!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.190
Don't be silly.

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:07.220
The sea is infested with sharks and the current is horrible.

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:09.500
S-Sharks?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:17.420
Listen closely, head north when you leave the cave.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:22.060
If you do, you will see a huge white rock.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:24.640
And I look below it, right?

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.380
That's right. You'll find a little rowboat there that I made.

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:30.520
Use it to get to the Hispaniola.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.850
Thanks, Ben Gunn!
Thanks a million!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.590
I've made it!
That's it!

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:01.580
This isn't easy!

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:10.960
I'm farther away than before!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:12.620
Damn it!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:14.960
Damn it!

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.300
I lost the oar!

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:43.310
We'll never be able to reach the Hispaniola.

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:45.160
And we're so far from the island.

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:47.270
What are we going to do, Benbow?

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.930
We're getting farther and farther away.

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:54.400
We can't even get back to the island.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.230
All you do is "meow"!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:57.840
Meow!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.150
Time-out!

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:18.030
This isn't the time to fight.

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:21.850
We have to find a way to get back to the island.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:24.190
Let's go!

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.240
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:02.860
A shark!

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:52.410
Benbow? Benbow!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.370
BENBOW!

00:15:05.390 --> 00:15:06.710
Hurry, grab this!

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:33.850
I think it's useless to row, Benbow...

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.820
Would everyone at the fort...

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:39.450
...be holding out?

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:06.370
We're going back! The current is pushing us towards the island.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:09.090
Alright!

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.310
Damn...

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:50.670
It's pointless to continue in this fog.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.550
We'd just be wasting powder.

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:55.550
You, that'll be all for today.
Cease fire.

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.760
Very well!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.300
Hey!
Cease fire!

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:02.220
Cease fire!

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.060
Understood!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.290
Hey!

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:07.350
Send the cease fire signal!

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.110
Aye-aye sir, I'm on it!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.740
Hey, it's the signal!
Cease fire!

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:25.130
Finally...

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:29.080
I'm done for.
We've been at it all day...

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:39.760
We need a good bottle of rum. It's been a rough day...

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:42.600
Ah, damn it!
My poor ears...

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:18.340
Darn...
We'll never make it, Benbow.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.230
With this fog,

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:22.800
I don't even know what direction we're going.

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:27.770
For all we know, we've drifted back to sea.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:36.690
This is bad...
It's too soon to give up!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.670
What luck!
The Hispaniola!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:58.640
What have I done?!

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:12.420
Benbow, can you swim?

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:15.330
Here I go!

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:01.550
Alright, only one left.

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:32.080
To      be        continued

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:36.800
shiokaze yo omae mo

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:36.800
Hey sea breeze

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:42.610
tomodachi naraba tsutaete

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:42.610
If you're my friend then carry

00:22:43.830 --> 00:22:48.820
furusato ni nokoshite kita

00:22:43.830 --> 00:22:48.820
To my home that I've left behind

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:54.260
natsukashii haha ni hitokoto

00:22:48.820 --> 00:22:54.260
A word to my dear mother

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:59.670
boku wa genki de yattemasu

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:59.670
Tell her that I'm doing fine

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:05.130
kaban ippai no

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:05.130
And that my bag filled

00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:10.760
nozomi to yume to takaramono

00:23:05.130 --> 00:23:10.760
With hopes, dreams and treasures

00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:16.620
kakaete kaeritai

00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:16.620
Will be brought back

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:23.210
yuuyake wo senaka ni

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:23.210
The sunset on my back

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:29.100
kamome wo kata ni tomarasete

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:29.100
And a seagull perched on my shoulder

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:38.820
boku wa fukimasu kuchibue wo

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:38.820
I blow out a whistle

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:47.330
Just you wait, dirty flag!

00:23:47.330 --> 00:23:49.810
You won't fly on the Hispaniola any longer.

00:23:49.810 --> 00:23:54.130
I'm going to take down this
cursed skull and crossbones!

00:23:54.130 --> 00:23:56.050
Even I can do something like that!

00:23:56.650 --> 00:23:59.410
But, on the deck hidden by the fog,

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:02.290
I witness a very frightening scene.

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:03.930
Actually, it's...

00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:07.810
Next time on Treasure Island:
"Don't Underestimate Me, I'm Not a Kid"

00:24:07.810 --> 00:24:09.450
Don't watch it alone!

